PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_Its50YForChildsTicket::
    .string "Yes, yes. It is ¥50 for a child.\p"
    .string "Nothing in here still runs, if that\n"
    .string "is what you were hoping.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ComeAgain::
    .string "Come again. It will all still be\n"
    .string "here.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_Right50YThankYou::
    .string "¥50. Thank you.\p"
    .string "Mind the cases.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DontHaveEnoughMoney::
    .string "That is more than you have.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_PleaseEnjoyYourself::
    .string "Take your time. Most do not.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DoYouKnowWhatAmberIs::
    .string "You cannot come in the back way.\p"
    .string "Nice try.\p"
    .string "Since you are here. Do you know\n"
    .string "what a CORE is?$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AmberContainsGeneticMatter::
    .string "A CORE holds everything a daemon\n"
    .string "was, at the moment it stopped.\p"
    .string "There is a lab somewhere trying to\n"
    .string "start one again.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AmberIsFossilizedSap::
    .string "A CORE is wire and iron. Rings on a\n"
    .string "grid, threaded by hand.\p"
    .string "Everything anyone knew how to keep\n"
    .string "was kept that way once.$"

@ Unused
PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_PleaseGoAround::
    .string "あちらへ　おまわりください$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ShouldBeGratefulForLongLife::
    .string "I have had a long life.\p"
    .string "Though I worked on one of these.\p"
    .string "It is strange to see it labelled.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WantYouToGetAmberExamined::
    .string "Ssh. I have to tell someone.\p"
    .string "This CORE is not empty. There is\n"
    .string "still something in it.\p"
    .string "I have said so for eleven years.\p"
    .string "My colleagues write it down and\n"
    .string "file it. They are very polite.\p"
    .string "Take it. Get it read somewhere\n"
    .string "that still has the equipment.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ReceivedOldAmberFromMan::
    .string "{PLAYER} received the OLD CORE\n"
    .string "from the man.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_GetOldAmberChecked::
    .string "Ssh.\n"
    .string "Get the OLD CORE read.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DontHaveSpaceForThis::
    .string "You have no room for this.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WeHaveTwoFossilsOnExhibit::
    .string "We have two CORES on exhibit, both\n"
    .string "recovered from Deadstack.\p"
    .string "And a USERBOX, in the case by the\n"
    .string "stairs. Donated last year.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_BeautifulPieceOfAmber::
    .string "A CORE alone in its case. The wire\n"
    .string "is unbroken. It is very old.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AerodactylFossil::
    .string "HELIX CORE. Recovered from\n"
    .string "Deadstack. Contents unread.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_KabutopsFossil::
    .string "DOME CORE. Recovered from\n"
    .string "Deadstack. Contents unread.$"

